  "text": "Skip to content\nFully insured shipping\nAuthenticity guaranteed\nWe buy it back\nNYC Diamond District counter\nSecure checkout\nAustralia 1 oz Silver Kangaroo Coin .999 Random Years\nby\nPerth Mint\n✓ LBMA Good Delivery\n$\n67.49\nPriced live off the spot market.\nSee price history ↓\nMetal\nSilver\nWeight\n1 oz Troy Ounces\nPurity\n99.9\nType\nCoin\n86 In stock\nQty\nQuantity\nCheck/Wire\nCrypto\nCard/Paypal\n1-9\n1 - 9\n0%\n$\n66.81\n$\n68.15\n$\n70.15\n10-99\n10 - 99\n0.05%\n$\n66.78\n$\n68.11\n$\n70.12\n100+\n100 +\n1%\n$\n66.14\n$\n67.46\n$\n69.45\nAdd to wishlist\nGo to compare\nAdd to compare\nFully insured shipping\nShips in 1–3 business days\nWe buy it back —\nsell to us\nSecure checkout · NYC Diamond District counter\nSKU:\ns1okang1\nCategories:\nGovernment Mint Silver Coins\n,\nGovernment Minted Silver Coins\n,\nSilver\n,\nSilver Coins\nTags:\nAustralian\n,\nKangaroo\n,\nPerth Mint\nMint:\nPerth Mint\nPrice history\nAustralia 1 oz Silver Kangaroo Coin .999 Random Years was last recorded at $67.12 on October 7, 2026. Over the past 12 months it is up 3.5% and has ranged between $62.62 and $140.59.\nLast recorded\nLoading…\n1Y\n7D\n1M\n3M\n6M\n1Y\nAll\nDescription\nAdditional information\nDescription\nThe Perth Mint’s kangaroo coins and bullion are famous around the globe, with new release coins popular with coin collectors and bullion investors. Buy now before they sell out.\nStruck from 1oz of 99.99% pure silver, this top-selling bullion coin has consistently been a popular choice for investors and stackers.\\\nThe coin incorporates an authentication feature on the reverse. In the form of a micro-laser engraved letter, it is only detectable under a magnifying glass\nDesign of the Australia 1 oz Silver Kangaroo coin .999 Random Years\nA powerful symbol of national pride, the kangaroo embodies the spirit, resilience, and natural beauty of Australia. As a result, it takes pride of place on the nation’s signature investment coin series.\nThe coin’s iconic design portrays a bounding kangaroo surrounded by stylized rays of bursting sunlight. Inscriptions on a wavy-lined border include ‘AUSTRALIAN KANGAROO’ and the coin’s weight, purity, and year-date, together with The Perth Mint’s ‘P’ mintmark. The coin’s obverse depicts the Dan Thorne effigy of Her Majesty Queen Elizabeth the II.\nMain Highlights of the Australia 1 oz Silver Kangaroo coin .999 Random Years\nContains 1 oz of .9999 fine silver.\nMinted by Perth Mint in Australia.\nAvailable in Brilliant Uncirculated condition.\nSovereign coin backed by the Australian government.\nDepending on the Random year we ship it may be .999 or .9999 purity\nProduct Specifications: Australia 1 oz Silver Kangaroo coin .999 Random Years\nSpecification\nDetails\nBrand\nPerth Mint\nThickness\n3.50 mm\nDiameter\n40.90 mm\nEdge Design\nReeded\nPurity\n.999\nCondition\nNew\nMetal Weight\n1 oz.\nBuying Australia 1 oz Silver Kangaroo coin .999 Random Years\nCustomers should know that the famous Perth Mint Lunar Series frequently sells out earlier than other series. We invite investors and collectors to benefit from our fresh supply as soon as possible. Of course, the\nPerth Mint\nin Australia is renowned for its superb craftsmanship. The mint was founded in 1899 as a division of the Royal Mint of Great Britain. The Perth Mint is still a top global mint today, and its silver bullion products are highly sought-after.\nAdditional information\nMetal\nSilver\nProduct Type\nlegal_tender_coin\nIssuer Country\nAU\nIs Legal Tender\nYes\nIs Monetized Bullion\nYes\nPurity %\n99.9\nType of Bullion\nCoin\nWeight Unit\nTroy Ounces\nWeight\n1 oz\nRelated products\nQty\nAdd to cart\n1 Oz Silver Bars\n,\nSilver\n,\nSilver Bars\n1 Oz Silver Bar (Random Brands)\n$\n71.78\nQty\nAdd to cart\nQuickview\nGo to compare\nAdd to compare\nQty\nAdd to cart\n1 Oz Silver Bars\n,\nGifts\n,\nSilver\n,\nSilver Bars\n,\nSilver Bullets for Sale\n2 oz Silver Bullet\n$\n159.11\nQty\nAdd to cart\nQuickview\nGo to comp